# Design system (www)

Read `.impeccable.md` before adding or restyling UI.

Landing (`/`) is the source of truth: Geist Mono, `#0a0a0a` blueprint grid (`.bg-app-dots`), `siteShellClassName` (`max-w-4xl px-6 sm:px-8`), yellow underline accent (`UnderlineText` / `.decoration-primary`).

## Catalog pages

Use `ToolSubpageLayout` + `PageContainer` + `Section` (title via `UnderlineText`). Copy the Posts/Apps row: `mb-4 flex items-center gap-2`, muted `w-8` meta, name with `hover:underline hover:underline-offset-8`, optional aside hidden below `sm`, `ArrowUpRight` on hover.

Nested routes: shadcn `Breadcrumb` primitives (`BreadcrumbLink asChild` + Next `Link`, `BreadcrumbPage` for current). Page title is a separate yellow-underlined `h2`.

## Do not

- Tables, uppercase tracked column labels, or `border-t` table rules for catalogs
- Italic yellow last-word headlines (Inspirations-only)
- Card grids for posts, apps, or bookmarks
- Hover-to-yellow text; hover is underline
- A second typeface or heading scale on catalog pages
